{"message":"It applies to your overall Rho-Bank checking relationship—not to the specific account you use for the referral. Eligibility is measured from the date you opened your first-ever Rho-Bank checking account, and the account type does not matter.

So, for a Green Fee-Free referral, you qualify if your earliest checking account was opened at least 30 days ago. Opening the Light Green Account a few weeks ago does not restart the clock; your Green Fee-Free Account may already satisfy the requirement if it was opened earlier.

For the best combined bonus based on her approximately $600 deposit, Green Fee-Free remains the top eligible choice: $20 for you plus $35 for her, or $55 total. She must deposit at least $300 within 60 days, using new money, and keep the deposit for the required retention period."}
